    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "the taker",
      "when": {
        "calc": "trick_in_hand == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "bid_pass_value if you.bid_choice == 'Pass' or you.bid_choice == '' else int(you.bid_choice)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_key",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bid * tiebreak_key_bid_multiplier + (len(players) - ((p.seat - priority_seat + len(players)) % len(players))) for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "taker",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.seat for p in players if p.bid * tiebreak_key_bid_multiplier + (len(players) - ((p.seat - priority_seat + len(players)) % len(players))) == best_key][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "contract",
            "value": {
              "calc": "all_pass_contract if max([p.bid for p in players]) == bid_pass_value else max([p.bid for p in players])"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {taker} is the Taker with contract {contract}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "declare",
      "label": "the declaration",
      "when": {
        "calc": "trick_in_hand == 1"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == taker"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Spades, partner seat 1",
          "Spades, partner seat 2",
          "Spades, partner seat 3",
          "Spades, partner seat 4",
          "Clubs, partner seat 1",
          "Clubs, partner seat 2",
          "Clubs, partner seat 3",
          "Clubs, partner seat 4",
          "Hearts, partner seat 1",
          "Hearts, partner seat 2",
          "Hearts, partner seat 3",
          "Hearts, partner seat 4",
          "Diamonds, partner seat 1",
          "Diamonds, partner seat 2",
          "Diamonds, partner seat 3",
          "Diamonds, partner seat 4"
        ]
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "decl"
      },
      "text": "You are the Taker with contract {contract}. Choose the trump suit and a partner seat. Naming another seat makes a call: that player alone is privately told they are your partner. Naming your own seat makes a solo: nobody is told anything beyond the trump suit. Only the trump suit is announced now; the partner seat is revealed when the hand ends."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "declare",
      "label": "trump is named",
      "when": {
        "calc": "trick_in_hand == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trump",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if 'Spades' in $decl else (2 if 'Clubs' in $decl else (3 if 'Hearts' in $decl else 4))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "partner_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if 'seat 1' in $decl else (2 if 'seat 2' in $decl else (3 if 'seat 3' in $decl else 4))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "is_solo",
            "value": {
              "calc": "partner_seat == taker"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trump_name",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['Spades', 'Clubs', 'Hearts', 'Diamonds'][trump - 1]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "The Taker names {trump_name} as trump. Spadille (11) and Baste (21) are also trumps."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "declare",
      "label": "the partner is told",
      "when": {
        "calc": "trick_in_hand == 1 and not is_solo"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "partner_seat"
            },
            "key": "is_partner",
            "value": true,
            "text": "You are the Taker's partner in this hand. Keep it secret.",
            "announce_to": {
              "where": "you.seat == partner_seat"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "lead",
      "label": "the leader",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "leader",
            "value": {
              "calc": "taker if trick_in_hand == 1 else last_winner"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[['1', '2', '3', '4'][int(c / 10) - 1] + ['1', '2', '3', '4', '5'][c % 10 - 1] + ' ' + ['Ace', 'Two', 'Jack', 'Queen', 'King'][c % 10 - 1] + ' of ' + ['Spades', 'Clubs', 'Hearts', 'Diamonds'][int(c / 10) - 1] for c in sorted(you.hand)]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {leader} leads this trick."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "lead",
      "label": "the lead",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == leader"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "lead"
      },
      "text": "You lead this trick. Trump is {trump_name}. Play any card from your hand (each option shows the card's code and name)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "lead",
      "label": "the led card",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "leader"
            },
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int($lead[0]) * 10 + int($lead[1])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "leader"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int($lead[0]) * 10 + int($lead[1])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "lead_name",
            "value": "$lead"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_suit",
            "value": {
              "calc": "trump if (int($lead[0]) * 10 + int($lead[1])) == spadille_code or (int($lead[0]) * 10 + int($lead[1])) == baste_code else int($lead[0])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "choice",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[['1', '2', '3', '4'][int(c / 10) - 1] + ['1', '2', '3', '4', '5'][c % 10 - 1] + ' ' + ['Ace', 'Two', 'Jack', 'Queen', 'King'][c % 10 - 1] + ' of ' + ['Spades', 'Clubs', 'Hearts', 'Diamonds'][int(c / 10) - 1] for c in sorted(you.hand) if (trump if c == spadille_code or c == baste_code else int(c / 10)) == led_suit] if any([(trump if c == spadille_code or c == baste_code else int(c / 10)) == led_suit for c in you.hand]) else [['1', '2', '3', '4'][int(c / 10) - 1] + ['1', '2', '3', '4', '5'][c % 10 - 1] + ' ' + ['Ace', 'Two', 'Jack', 'Queen', 'King'][c % 10 - 1] + ' of ' + ['Spades', 'Clubs', 'Hearts', 'Diamonds'][int(c / 10) - 1] for c in sorted(you.hand)]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {leader} leads {lead_name}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "follow",
      "label": "the follow",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != leader"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "store": "choice",
      "text": "Seat {leader} led {lead_name}. Trump is {trump_name}. Play a card: if you hold any card of the led suit (Spadille and Baste count as trump suit) you must play one, and only those are offered; otherwise you may play any card."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "the trick is won",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != leader and you.choice != ''"
            },
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(you.choice[0]) * 10 + int(you.choice[1])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != leader and you.choice != ''"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(you.choice[0]) * 10 + int(you.choice[1])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "power",
            "value": {
              "calc": "power_spadille if you.played_card == spadille_code else (power_manille if you.played_card == 10 * trump + 2 else (power_baste if you.played_card == baste_code else (power_trump_base + you.played_card % 10 if int(you.played_card / 10) == trump else (you.played_card % 10 if int(you.played_card / 10) == led_suit else power_off_suit))))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['Seat ' + ['1', '2', '3', '4'][p.seat - 1] + ': ' + ['1', '2', '3', '4'][int(p.played_card / 10) - 1] + ['1', '2', '3', '4', '5'][p.played_card % 10 - 1] + ' ' + ['Ace', 'Two', 'Jack', 'Queen', 'King'][p.played_card % 10 - 1] + ' of ' + ['Spades', 'Clubs', 'Hearts', 'Diamonds'][int(p.played_card / 10) - 1] for p in players if p.played_card > 0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "last_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.seat for p in players if p.power == max([q.power for q in players])][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "last_winner"
            },
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "last_winner"
            },
            "key": "hand_tricks",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Cards played: {trick_cards}. Seat {last_winner} wins the trick."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "the hand is scored",
      "when": {
        "calc": "trick_in_hand == tricks_per_hand"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_total",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([p.hand_tricks for p in players if p.seat == taker or p.seat == partner_seat])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_delta",
            "value": {
              "calc": "contract - 1 if hand_total >= contract else (-(contract - 1) if hand_total == contract - 1 else -contract)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "((solo_multiplier * hand_delta) if you.seat == taker else -hand_delta) if is_solo else (hand_delta if you.seat == taker or you.seat == partner_seat else -hand_delta)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "partner_label",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'it was a solo by seat ' + ['1', '2', '3', '4'][taker - 1] if is_solo else 'the partner was seat ' + ['1', '2', '3', '4'][partner_seat - 1]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "the hand result",
      "when": {
        "calc": "trick_in_hand == tricks_per_hand"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "The hand is over: {partner_label}. Taker seat {taker}, contract {contract}, tricks T = {hand_total}, d = {hand_delta}. Scores: seat 1 {players[0].score}, seat 2 {players[1].score}, seat 3 {players[2].score}, seat 4 {players[3].score}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "score",
      "label": "after the last trick",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_no >= rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_no >= rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.score * 100 + you.tricks_won",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final scores (tricks won): Seat 1 {players[0].score} ({players[0].tricks_won}), Seat 2 {players[1].score} ({players[1].tricks_won}), Seat 3 {players[2].score} ({players[2].tricks_won}), Seat 4 {players[3].score} ({players[3].tricks_won})."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 40,
    "rounds_max": 41,
    "actions_max": 3000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "PACK: {deck_size} cards, {suits} suits of {ranks_per_suit} ranks: A, 2, J, Q, K. Suits are numbered Spades 1, Clubs 2, Hearts 3, Diamonds 4; ranks A 1, 2 2, J 3, Q 4, K 5. A card's code is 10 x suit + rank (K of Hearts = 35). {spadille_code} is the Ace of Spades (Spadille), {baste_code} the Ace of Clubs (Baste). Cards are always shown by code and name.\n\nSEATS: Seats 1-4 sit clockwise. Everyone has a public score (starts 0), tricks won over the game (starts 0) and hand tricks (reset to 0 each hand).\n\nSTRUCTURE: {hands} hands of {tricks_per_hand} tricks, {rounds} rounds; one round is one trick. The priority seat of hand h is ((h-1) mod 4)+1: 1, 2, 3, 4, 1, 2, 3, 4.\n\nSTART OF EACH HAND: 1. DEAL: the 20 cards are shuffled and {hand_size} are dealt privately to each player; every hand tricks count is set to 0. 2. BID: all players at the same moment choose Pass, {bid_min}, 4 or {bid_max}: the number of tricks out of 5 their side promises to win. All bids are announced. 3. TAKER: the highest bid wins. Ties go to the tied player who comes first clockwise starting from the priority seat (that seat itself first). If all four pass, the priority seat is Taker with contract {all_pass_contract}. The winning bid is the contract B. 4. DECLARATION: the Taker privately chooses a trump suit (Spades, Clubs, Hearts or Diamonds) and a partner seat (any of seats 1-4, including their own): {declaration_options} options. The trump suit is announced to all. If the partner seat is another player, the hand is a CALL and that player alone is privately told 'you are the Taker's partner'. If the Taker names their own seat, the hand is a SOLO and nobody is told anything beyond the trump suit. Nobody else learns the partner seat until the hand ends.\n\nTRUMPS: every card of the trump suit plus Spadille (11) and Baste (21), whatever the trump suit. Spadille and Baste count as trump-suit cards and as no other suit. Manille is the 2 of the trump suit. With red trump there are {trumps_red} trumps; with black trump there are {trumps_black}.\n\nPLAY OF A TRICK: on the first trick of a hand the Taker leads; afterwards the winner of the previous trick leads. The leader plays any card from their hand; it is removed and shown to all. The led suit is the trump suit if the led card is Spadille, Baste or any trump-suit card, otherwise the led card's suit. The other three then each choose a card at the same moment. A player holding any card of the led suit (counting Spadille and Baste as trump suit) must play one, and is offered only those cards. A player holding none may play any card. Illegal cards are never offered.\n\nCARD POWER (t = trump suit): Spadille {power_spadille}; Manille (code 10t+2) {power_manille}; Baste {power_baste}; other trump-suit card {power_trump_base} + rank; non-trump card of the led suit: its rank; any other card {power_off_suit}. The highest power wins the trick (ties cannot occur). All four cards and the winner are announced, and the winner adds 1 to their tricks won and hand tricks.\n\nHAND SCORING (after the fifth trick): T = the Taker's hand tricks, plus the partner's if the hand is a call. d = B-1 if T >= B (made); d = -(B-1) if T = B-1 (remise); d = -B if T <= B-2 (codille). CALL: the Taker and the partner each gain d; the other two each lose d. SOLO: the Taker gains {solo_multiplier} x d; each of the other three loses d. Every hand sums to zero. The partner seat (or that it was a solo), T, d and all scores are then announced.\n\nNO TALK: there is no discussion; all communication is through bids and cards.\n\nEND: after round {rounds} the highest score wins. Among players tied on score, the one with the most tricks won over the game wins (ranking = score x {rank_score_multiplier} + tricks won); players still level share the win (a draw)."
}
